<%- include('layouts/base', { title: 'Privacy Policy', body: `
<div class="container legal-page">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="text-secondary">Last updated: ${new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}</p>

  <section>
    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p><strong>Permanent accounts (@wox.world):</strong> Username, password (hashed with Argon2id), recovery email (optional), 2FA secret (encrypted). We do not read your emails.</p>
    <p><strong>Personal temp mail:</strong> Password (hashed), IP address (for rate limiting), session token. Automatically deleted on expiry.</p>
    <p><strong>Public temp mail:</strong> IP address (for rate limiting). No personal information collected. Automatically deleted on expiry.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To provide email services and authenticate your identity</li>
      <li>To prevent abuse (rate limiting, IP blocking)</li>
      <li>To generate anonymous usage statistics</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>3. Data Retention</h2>
    <p>Public temp mail data is deleted within 3 days. Personal temp mail data is deleted within 60 days. Permanent account data is retained until you delete your account.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>4. Data Security</h2>
    <p>Passwords are hashed with Argon2id. All connections use TLS encryption via Cloudflare. 2FA secrets are encrypted at rest.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>5. Contact</h2>
    <p>For privacy questions, email <span class="mono">${process.env.SUPPORT_EMAIL || process.env.ADMIN_EMAIL || 'support@' + (process.env.DOMAIN_PERMANENT || 'wox.world')}</span>.</p>
  </section>
</div>
` }) %>

<style>
  .legal-page { max-width: 800px; padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }
  .legal-page h1 { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .legal-page h2 { margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 1.25rem; }
  .legal-page p, .legal-page li { color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.8; }
  .legal-page ul { padding-left: 1.5rem; }
  .legal-page section { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
</style>
